		"en": [
			"From \"MOBILE SUIT GUNDAM IRON-BLOODED ORPHANS\", the mass-produced MS of Gjallarhorn is now available! Two forms, a captain machine with horns and a general machine without horns, can be reproduced by replacing parts! The head is equipped with a deployment gimmick, and the internal structure with spherical parts is also reproduced! Various equipment such as a rifle and a battle axe that can be mounted on the waist are also included! Molded ×6, Foil Seal ×1, Assembly Instructions ×1"
		]
